' uci-to-tlcs server.ini for a fastchess tournament.
' Keys are UPPERCASE, start at column 0, no spaces around '='. Lines starting with ' are comments.
' Relative paths resolve against this file's directory. CLI flags override these values.
PATH=fc.log
' ^ fastchess:  -log file=fc.log engine=true realtime=true
TOURNEYPGN=games.pgn
' ^ fastchess:  -pgnout file=games.pgn
FORMAT=fastchess
PORT=16000
SITE=My fastchess tournament
DELAY=100
DELAYAFTERMOVE=0
DELAYAFTERGAME=0
SAVEDEBUG=0
'MENU ID=1 WIDTH=12000 HEIGHT=6000 NAME="Schedule" URL="https://example.com/schedule"
' Up to 10 MENU lines (ID=1..10), sent verbatim to viewers at logon.
' Extensions (not in the reference server):
'BIND=127.0.0.1
'STATEFILE=state.json
'CLIENTTIMEOUT=70
'MAXCLIENTS=0
'ADMINPASS=change-me
